            "detailed_description": "<h1>Coverage</h1><p><i>&quot;An experience that doesn't quite fit inside a specific genre... From beginning to end Unto the End is immensely rewarding and captivating&quot;</i><br>Screen Rant – 9/10<br><br><i>&quot;Unto The End is not an easy game, but it is only as hard as you make it for yourself... Easy to recommend to those who enjoy tough fighting challenges&quot;</i><br>TheSixthAxis – 9/10<br><br><i>&quot;Unlike anything that I’ve had the opportunity to play before... Despite existing only on a two-dimensional plane, 2 Ton Studios has somehow managed to cram the heart of a 'Souls' game into this diminutive package&quot;</i><br>PC Invasion – 8/10<br><br><i>&quot;If you're a fan of tough but rewarding games that aren't unfair or constantly cheap, this one is certainly worth a look&quot;</i><br>",
            "about_the_game": "Domine o combate tático com a espada, ou descubra maneiras de evitar derramamento de sangue. Uma jornada que confia em você do começo ao fim.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARACTERÍSTICAS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/2d459c6a39ad8caee257722193d4e355.poster.avif?t=1779295617\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/2d459c6a39ad8caee257722193d4e355.webm?t=1779295617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/2d459c6a39ad8caee257722193d4e355.mp4?t=1779295617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Combate de observação-reação:</strong> sistema único de combate focado na habilidade e mestria, concebido e construído do zero especificamente para 2D. Luta com inteligência e ataca de forma tática com a tua espada e outras armas de alcance em batalhas renhidas de um para um e de grupo.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/1b4a5a5c14a1ceaf5d5bdee2d81e9ac1.poster.avif?t=1779295617\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/1b4a5a5c14a1ceaf5d5bdee2d81e9ac1.webm?t=1779295617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/1b4a5a5c14a1ceaf5d5bdee2d81e9ac1.mp4?t=1779295617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Encontros detalhados desenhados à mão:</strong> a aventura desenrola-se através de encontros cuidadosamente criados, cada um com oponentes dignos e inteligentes, todos com suas próprias motivações e o seu lugar no mundo.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/25c4e6dbd7657b0dfb46137a26f60f96.poster.avif?t=1779295617\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/25c4e6dbd7657b0dfb46137a26f60f96.webm?t=1779295617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/25c4e6dbd7657b0dfb46137a26f60f96.mp4?t=1779295617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Foco na habilidade do jogador:</strong> uma experiência desafiante para um jogador com o mínimo de indicações. Todas as habilidades do pai estão disponíveis desde o início, e o segredo para sobreviver e triunfar é dominar essas habilidades e observar bem o teu ambiente.<br><br><strong>Terreno imperdoável:</strong> desde ruínas subterrâneas cavernosas aos picos escarpados das montanhas, supera desafios ambientais e armadilhas letais enquanto viajas por um mundo de cenários meticulosamente criados.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/91fdc75ebb1ef54cf512c6a2240f618e.poster.avif?t=1779295617\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/91fdc75ebb1ef54cf512c6a2240f618e.webm?t=1779295617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600080/extras/91fdc75ebb1ef54cf512c6a2240f618e.mp4?t=1779295617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
